# Orbit-Remote-Server (orbit-firewall): its page and pairing, and the video,
# sound and input of a session (WebRTC, whose ICE takes its ports from this
# range: serve.rs's ICE_PORTS), to the local network and the tunnels.
add rule inet orbit lan_in tcp dport 7311 accept comment "Orbit Remote Server"
add rule inet orbit lan_in udp dport 7320-7339 accept comment "Orbit Remote Server (WebRTC)"
